OL,3,AVan Gogh painting sells for record     
OL,4,A$190.4m after row over its Nazi history
OL,6,FAuction house Sotheby's has sold a     
OL,7,Fpainting by Vincent van Gogh for a     
OL,8,Frecord $190.4m (#144.8m).              
OL,10,FThe sale of Chataigniers en fleurs     
OL,11,F("Chestnut Trees in Blossom") shatters 
OL,12,Fthe renowned artist's previous auction 
OL,13,Frecord of $117.2 million set in 2022.  
OL,15,FThe historic sale in New York on       
OL,16,FWednesday comes after an eleventh-hour 
OL,17,Fagreement was reached to resolve a     
OL,18,Fdispute regarding claims the art piece 
OL,19,Fwas previously sold under duress during
OL,20,Fthe rise of the Nazis.                 
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
