OL,3,AVan Gogh painting sells for record     
OL,4,A$190.4m after row over its Nazi history
OL,6,FChataigniers en fleurs was painted in  
OL,7,F1890 in the final two months of Van    
OL,8,FGogh's life. It is considered one of   
OL,9,Fthe most important works of art from   
OL,10,Fthat period to remain in private hands,
OL,11,Faccording to Sotheby's.                
